What I do is have a cron job run at a suitable time that 
overwrites .profiles with a new .profile that has something
like

echo "The system is currently unavilable"
exit 0

At the very end of it.
I then kill off any logged on users and do the backup. Another cron
job copies back the original .profiles.

Hope this helps.


