> I have a DEC 3000 model 300 running DU 4.0c which I just upgraded from
> DU 3.2c.  It apprears to be working fine (except for a few minor
> problems which I will post in seperate messages).  I have one concern.
> When I reboot, I get an error message "the disklabel for rz6c does not
