> working fine.  Any suggestions?  Should I put a new disklabel on it?
> Any other soulutions?  Will I loose all my data if I put a put a new
> disklabel on.

Well, disklabel shouldnt destroy any data on the disk, it *JUST* writes
in partitions.

Theoretically, you could write the exact label as the old one, over, and
the data should be intact. If there is a mismatch, you're in trouble.
But don't take my word for it, backup before doing anything.

As to, why you're getting that error message, I'm not sure. It should be
compatible.

Nix.



