> options : java enabled etc... OK. but applets are not running...
>
> Is there any problem with libraries ?... Because I found on the net only
> netscape for OSF 3.2...
>

Bernard,

This has been a problem for a long time with Netscape on DIGITAL UNIX.
It revolves around changes to X11 between R5 and R6 (referred to as
the poll/select issue). No currently shipping version of Netscape
(including v3.04) properly supports Java because of this. However,
it has been resolved in version 4.0 of the Navigator (currently in
beta, available from Netscape's FTP site). I have been using it for
a few weeks and have found it to be pretty stable.

Downside: due to constraints I don't fully understand, the 4.x series
of the Netscape Navigator product will only have the browser component.
Mail and News have been removed.

